# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Product name: Virtual-Q

Tagline: Skip the wait. Live more.

Product category: Smart Digital Queue Management System.

Core objective:

Virtual-Q helps customers join physical business queues remotely, receive digital tokens, monitor their queue positions and arrive when their turns approach.

It helps businesses manage customers, service counters, waiting lists, orders and business operations through one dashboard.

Target businesses:

- Restaurants and cafes
- Hospitals and clinics
- Salons and barbershops
- Banks and service centers
- Automobile service centers
- Other local businesses

Important positioning:

Virtual-Q is primarily a queue management platform, not a food delivery application.

Its primary value is reducing physical waiting time and improving business queue management.

