## 5.4 Smart Wait-Time Prediction

Implement a reliable calculation system.

Initial calculation:

Estimated waiting time = number of people ahead × average service duration.

Improve it using historical completed service durations.

Requirements:

- Calculate average service time.
- Maintain relevant historical records.
- Update estimates when the queue changes.
- Display an estimated range when appropriate.
- Display a sensible fallback when historical data is insufficient.
- Never claim predictions are guaranteed.

