- No concurrent queue corruption.
- Correct queue ordering.
- Correct counter assignments.
- Correct status transitions.
- Authorized queue updates only.
- Prevent customers from changing their own token position.
- Prevent unauthorized cancellation or modification.
- Prevent duplicate order submissions.

Implement appropriate PostgreSQL RPC functions or Supabase Edge Functions.

Do not trust queue positions, prices or totals supplied by the browser.

Recalculate sensitive values on the server.

